# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw data. ~123 MB, and olist_geolocation_dataset.csv alone is ~60 MB.
# Fetched with `make data`; never committed. Also avoids redistributing a
# CC BY-NC-SA dataset from this repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
archive/
*.csv
*.csv.gz
*.zip
# Seeds and the committed dashboard snapshot are the deliberate exceptions.
!transform/seeds/*.csv
!dashboard/data/*.parquet

# Replay output. Derived, regenerable (`make data && make backfill`), and ~29 MB
# across 56 windows -- committing it would contradict the clone-and-run claim
# and redistribute a CC BY-NC-SA dataset besides. `make clean` deletes it.
#
# Not to be confused with dashboard/data/*.parquet above, which is a committed
# snapshot of the MARTS and stays committed on purpose: the public demo has to
# survive a lapsed service-account credential.
data/slices/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Credentials. Listed before any GCP key exists on disk, on purpose.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.json
!.devcontainer/devcontainer.json
# Provenance for the committed dashboard snapshot -- row counts and build time.
!dashboard/data/_manifest.json
# Generated, but committed on purpose: it is what README.md is rendered from,
# and CI compares a fresh render against the committed one.
!docs/figures.json
# The one committed replay slice: a 45 KB test fixture, so the loader tests do
# not need the 123 MB source dataset.
!ingestion/tests/fixtures/**/_manifest.json

# Enrichment output. Committed, and for the same reason as the dashboard
# snapshot rather than as an exception to the rule above: replay slices are
# regenerable for free in minutes, these cost $3.19 and an API key. A fork with
# neither should still build the aspect marts and run the eval. It doubles as the
# cache, so a clone that loads it and re-runs spends nothing.
!enrichment/data/*.parquet
!package.json
!package-lock.json
credentials/
secrets/
service-account*.json
*-sa.json
gcp-key*.json
kaggle.json
*.pem
*.key
!transform/package-lock.yml

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# dbt
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
target/
dbt_packages/
logs/
.user.yml

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local warehouses
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.db

